opensps (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Renamed from fsps to opensps (libopensps 0.1.0, soname libopensps.so.0).
  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Build with Meson and debhelper-compat 13.
  * Split output into libopensps3 and libopensps-dev.
  * Exclude installed runtime data payload from binary packages.
  * Set Meson baseline optimization to x86-64-v3.

